parately from committed.\",\n      \"behavior_ids\": [\n        \"B_replication\",\n        \"B_storage_ready\",\n        \"B_application\"\n      ],\n      \"fact_ids\": [\n        \"F_committed\",\n        \"F_config\",\n        \"F_authority\"\n      ],\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"S_ack\",\n        \"S_async_contract\",\n        \"S_auto_leave\",\n        \"S_campaign\",\n        \"S_commit_reset\",\n        \"S_conf_contract\",\n        \"S_confchange\",\n        \"S_config\",\n        \"S_dispatch\",\n        \"S_joint\",\n        \"S_log_append\",\n        \"S_log_apply\",\n        \"S_log_commit\",\n        \"S_log_context\",\n        \"S_proposal\",\n        \"S_raw_completion\",\n        \"S_raw_ready\",\n        \"S_raw_storage\",\n        \"S_ready_contract\",\n        \"S_receive\",\n        \"S_restore\",\n        \"S_restore_config\",\n        \"S_restore_init\",\n        \"S_send\",\n        \"S_tracker\",\n        \"S_tracker_commit\",\n        \"S_usage\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"context\": {\n      \"explanation\": \"Tick or explicit campaign begins an election only for an eligible voter without pending snapshots or committed unapplied configuration changes. Vote choice is conditioned on local vote/leader state and candidate log freshness, with persistence-dependent replies and joint quorum counting. Higher terms normally install follower state; pre-vote and lease checks qualify this rule. Reset clears volatile aggregation and read-ack context, transfer target and pending configuration index, while committed history remains. Leader transfer pauses proposals, catches up a voter and sends TimeoutNow; it aborts on timeout or membership removal. Configuration changes activate on application, and snapshots/restart reconstruct configuration and history.\",\n      \"behavior_ids\": [\n        \"B_election\",\n        \"B_context_reset\",\n        \"B_transfer\",\n        \"B_configuration\",\n        \"B_recovery\"\n      ],\n      \"fact_ids\": [\